      "determinism": "deterministic",
      "implementation_slot": "node:org.orange.test/numbers@1",
      "x_test_behavior": "Fires then at once with a stream yielding 0..count-1. Item k is produced interval ns after the consumer pulled item k-1 (pull-based). Closing or cancelling the consumer closes the producer. Item 0 is produced interval ns after the first pull; the pull after the last item reports end-of-stream at once. If fail_at = Some(k), pulling item k fails with org.orange.test/Boom instead of yielding it; the stream is then closed."
    },
